        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Looze, Cody Miller, Blake Pieroni, Lilly King\n- Roles: swimming coach, swimmer\n- Events: 2016 Olympic Swimming Trials, 2016 Summer Olympics\n- Topics: Olympic qualification, swimming medals\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Looze is an American swimming coach.\n- At the 2016 Olympic Swimming Trials, Ray Looze coached Cody Miller, Blake Pieroni, and Lilly King, and all three qualified for the team.\n- At the 2016 Summer Olympics, Cody Miller won a bronze medal in the men's 100 metre breaststroke.\n- At the 2016 Summer Olympics, Cody Miller won a gold medal in the men's 4 × 100 metre medley relay and swam the breaststroke leg in the final.",
